{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Sampler","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28","fileName":"Sampler.swift"},"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Sampling","generated":true,"anchor":"Sampling","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/InvalidSampleRate"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what they set:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: try SampleRate(0.1)),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: try SampleRate(0.5)),","])"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; one no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Type Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"]}],"sections":[